('J.P. Morgan found roughly 40% of Russell 3000 stocks suffered permanent declines of 70% or more from peak.','J.P. Morgan research found roughly 40%','Matches J.P. Morgan "Agony & Ecstasy" (2014, 1980-2014 sample) per analyst recall, not fetched; the study is dated.',[]),
